The file’s existing non-terminating idioms include:

- **Latched diagnostic followed by the common read-response tail:** the six RE width declines, TEX read decline, and unmatched-address handling.
- **Latched diagnostic followed by a jump to the response tail:** the drawing-engine width decline’s `goto de_declined`, which skips register-specific handling and drawing. See [line 1179](C:/DocumentNoSnc/CC/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/src/devices/dev_sgi_re.c:1179).
